'' A VARIABLE OF AN 'extern "C++"' BLOCK LINKS BY ITS C++ NAME, as written and with no '$'
'' -- measured on fbc's object: _Z4cppv, _Z6CamelV, _Z4arrv, and _ZN2cn3nsvE in a
'' namespace. tiko gave fbc's own 'CPPV$' and '_ZN2cn4NSV$E' (audit F-55, SYM-10).
